cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Sigmoid: a topological world-model inference engine"
abstract: >-
  Sigmoid turns any model into a world model without touching its weights.
  The pipeline runs persistent homology into a Hilbert-series embedding,
  then into a coupling operator resolved at a Banach fixed point. One
  imagined step costs 97 microseconds against an 86 millisecond forward
  pass.
